When the Wizard reappears, he likes to do all nasty things like summon
nasties and curse stuff and such.
But he also tends to teleport to the staircase to heal when hurt, and
escape upstairs when you hurt him when he's already standing on the
stairs.
When he is fleeing and healing himself, he doesn't do those nasty things.
But when you kill him, he may reappear healed up and one explevel
stronger.
So, when he is alive anyway, keeping him hurt prevents him from getting
any stronger. And when he is carrying the Amulet, he doesn't actively
chase you.

